                "text": "GST)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                7
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2326,
                "endIndex": 2393,
                "text": "**Location:** Sherwood Road, Toowong (2 minutes from Indooroopilly)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2401,
                "endIndex": 2450,
                "text": "**Practice Areas:** Family law, wills and estates"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2482,
                "endIndex": 2579,
                "text": "**Free Initial Consultation:** Offers a free, no-obligation initial phone triage with a solicitor"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2589,
                "endIndex": 2733,
                "text": "**Fixed Fees:** Extensive menu of fixed fees for simple wills, enduring powers of attorney, consent orders, and uncontested divorce applications"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2983,
                "endIndex": 3106,
                "text": "**Will Drafting:** Standard will drafting is rarely deferred; it is almost universally billed on an upfront fixed-fee basis"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                10
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3113,
                "endIndex": 3283,
                "text": "**Estate Administration / Probate:** Most firms (including Centenary Lawyers and specialist Brisbane estate firms) will **defer fees until the estate funds are released**"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3285,
                "endIndex": 3414,
                "text": "In these cases, legal costs are paid directly from the deceased's bank account or asset sale proceeds at the time of distribution"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3421,
                "endIndex": 3620,
                "text": "**Estate Litigation (Will Disputes / Family Provision Claims):** These are frequently handled on a deferred-fee or \"No Win, No Fee\" basis if there is strong merit and substantial equity in the estate"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3670,
                "endIndex": 3855,
                "text": "**Direct Deferred Fee Agreements:** Boutique family lawyers occasionally agree to defer fees until final settlement if there is clear, unencumbered real property or equity to be divided"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3857,
                "endIndex": 3923,
                "text": "This must be requested and assessed during the initial appointment"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3930,
                "endIndex": 4098,
                "text": "**Litigation Funding (JustFund):** Many Brisbane western suburb family lawyers now partner with **JustFund** (Australia’s dedicated family law legal finance provider)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14,
                15
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4100,
                "endIndex": 4281,
                "text": "Under this arrangement, eligible clients do not pay out-of-pocket legal fees upfront; the financing is drawn progressively and repaid only once your property settlement is finalised"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14,
                15
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4322,
                "endIndex": 4560,
                "text": "**Ask for the Scope of \"Free\":** When booking an initial consult with firms like *Jindalee Lawyers* or *Koolik & Associates*, ask if the free consult is an initial **15–20 minute telephone triage** or an in-depth case-assessment meeting"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                13,
                0
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4564,
                "endIndex": 4770,
                "text": "**Bundle Wills with EPOAs:** If seeking a fixed-fee will, request a combined package price for both a **Will and an Enduring Power of Attorney (EPOA)**, as boutique firms typically offer discounted bundling"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                9,
                16
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4774,
                "endIndex": 5031,
                "text": "**Request a Costs Agreement with a Deferred Clause:** If you need a deferred fee for a property settlement or probate, specify this during your first discussion so the firm can assess your assets and determine whether they can defer billing until settlement"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11,
                13
              ]
            }
